Specifically, `OKF-SPEC.md` in this repository is a condensed and generalized
restatement of that specification. Changes made: the format is generalized from
data catalogs to project context of any domain (code, data, wikis); the vocabulary
of `type:` is treated as open; and normative rules on authority (§3.5), volatile
facts (§3.4) and the future-work layer were added by this project. Those additions
are original to okf-kit and are not part of, nor endorsed by, the upstream OKF.

The rest of this repository — the guide, templates, skills, linter, installer and
tooling — is original work of this project.
